/ A row of topic links. items is a list of [Topic, count] pairs (count may be
/ nil), url a proc giving each topic's link, active the key shown as selected,
/ css optional classes for the row (such as justify-content-center).
- active = local_assigns[:active]
.d-flex.flex-wrap.gap-2 class=local_assigns[:css]
  - items.each do |topic, count|
    - selected = topic.key == active
    = link_to url.call(topic), class: ['btn', 'btn-sm', selected ? 'btn-secondary' : 'btn-outline-secondary'],
        'aria-current': (selected ? 'true' : nil) do
      = topic.label
      - if count
        span.ms-1.opacity-75= number_with_delimiter(count)
